        ["Cloud cover", "Overcast preferred for mapping", "Even lighting eliminates harsh shadows; but lower contrast"],
        ["Cross-flight pattern", "Perpendicular to main grid", "Improves bundle adjustment, reduces bowling/doming effect"],
